# The Three Magi (windurst 66): a WAR 75 (Foe Finder MK I by GM: Recollections' 275 reads its own status). Available,
# not BLM: no 260; The Three Magi not completed: no 268: her 259. qm1, not accepted: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY; the Faded
# Crystal: nothing. Accepted by GM (no job read): qm1: SENSE_EVIL; the crystal: Chaos Elemental popped; made available
# again by GM while it is up: DO_NOT_SENSE (the first test reads no status); killed (its drop: the Glowstone) and gone:
# NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY. Chumimi: the Glowstone, available: nothing; accepted by GM: 261, and the stone: 269 (no job
# read; theThreeMagiSupport never set: Doctor Yoran-Oran Supporter). Completed, Recollections available: 268 (the key
# item held), also with The Root of the Problem accepted at var 1 by GM (268 comes before 277).
char zone=HeavensTower pos=0.0,30.75,21.5 job=WAR lvl=75
keyitem FoeFinderMkI
item FadedCrystal x2
login
trigger Chumimi                         # WAR, available (the key item held): her 259
finish
warp -333.5,-26.4,-49.2 Xarcabard
trigger qm1                             # not accepted: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
trade qm1 FadedCrystal x1               # not accepted: nothing
quest Windurst.TheThreeMagi accepted    # GM
trigger qm1                             # accepted (WAR): SENSE_EVIL
trade qm1 FadedCrystal x1               # Chaos Elemental popped; the crystal taken
quest Windurst.TheThreeMagi available   # GM
trigger qm1                             # up, available: DO_NOT_SENSE
kill CHAOS_ELEMENTAL                    # its drop: the Glowstone
tick 15000
tick 30000                              # gone
trigger qm1                             # available, not up: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
warp 0.0,30.75,21.5 HeavensTower
trade Chumimi Glowstone x1              # available: nothing
quest Windurst.TheThreeMagi accepted    # GM
trigger Chumimi                         # accepted (WAR): 261
finish
trade Chumimi Glowstone x1              # accepted: 269
finish                                  # wand; var 0: Doctor Yoran-Oran Supporter; needToZone; fame 20; completed
trigger Chumimi                         # completed, Recollections available, WAR (the key item held): 268
finish
quest Windurst.TheRootOfTheProblem accepted  # GM
charvar rootProblem 1
trigger Chumimi                         # 268 (before The Root of the Problem's 277)
finish
